    {
      "bbox": [
        221,
        1377,
        2087,
        1512
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "On April 19, Mayor Lindsay announced a number of reductions in City expenditures to take effect May 1. A copy of that announcement is attached.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.243,
          "min": -1.4128
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 31,
          "mean": -0.0018,
          "min": -0.0549
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7280,
        "area_px": 244120,
        "density": 0.02982,
        "chars": 143,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 19.64
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        221,
        1563,
        2091,
        1791
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "One of the Mayor's orders was to drastically reduce the number of City drivers for Administrators and Commissioners, using pool drivers when a vehicle is absolutely necessary. This office will be in touch with each of the agencies to discuss this matter in the next two weeks.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2242,
          "min": -1.4579
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 52,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0009
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 12588,
        "area_px": 411971,
        "density": 0.03056,
        "chars": 276,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 21.93
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        221,
        1835,
        2045,
        2027
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Your attention is also directed to the Mayor's order that overtime will be eliminated for all City employees effective May 1 except in uniformed services or when specifically approved by the Budget Director.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2415,
          "min": -1.6674
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 37,
          "mean": -0.0004,
          "min": -0.0092
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 11437,
        "area_px": 336576,
        "density": 0.03398,
        "chars": 207,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 18.1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        221,
        2063,
        2070,
        2212
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Further, that printing of all annual reports, newsletters, the Green Book, and other City publications is suspended unless specifically excepted by this office.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2347,
          "min": -1.5476
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 29,
          "mean": -0.0029,
          "min": -0.0826
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7523,
        "area_px": 266700,
        "density": 0.02821,
        "chars": 160,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 21.27
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        221,
        2241,
        2127,
        2484
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The task of cutting the City's public information personnel by 30% has been assigned to Tom Morgan, working with each Administrator. The job of cutting the City's community relations personnel by 30% has been assigned to Sid Davidoff, working with agency heads and with Jim Cavanagh, Deputy Budget Director.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2282,
          "min": -1.6218
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 65,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0036
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 12120,
        "area_px": 447740,
        "density": 0.02707,
        "chars": 307,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 25.33
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        221,
        2515,
        2138,
        2764
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In other cases covered by the Mayor's announcement, the Bureau of the Budget and the Administrators involved will carry out the Mayor's directions. The Bureau of the Budget will be responsible for reporting to the Mayor on the progress made in implementing these reductions no later than May 15.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
